{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/110844-{online}-archons-v20-google-hangouts-video-skype","id":110844,"title":"{ONLINE} Archons,V20 - Google Hangouts/Video Skype","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-11T09:24:46-07:00","id":110844,"title":"{ONLINE} Archons,V20 - Google Hangouts/Video Skype","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Verdana, Arial, Tahoma, Calibri, Geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">Not enough interest local...So, I'm taking it online! A Saturday evening Vampire the Masquerade 20th anniversary edition game via Google Hangouts or Video Skype from 7/8pm to 11pm/12am MST(GMT -7:00). Twice a month. I'm looking for three to four players. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">The campaign setting is a coterie of Archons working for the Ventrue Justicar and first Alastor Lucinde. Lucinde lost all but one of her Archons from a colossal mistake in judgement hunting and confronting a Red list member far beyond the combined strength of her Archon cadre. She only managed to escape through unknown thaumaturgical assistance of her last remaining Archon, Tremere Octivius Bartholomew Ashdown.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Our PC's; Powerful ancialle who could one day be Justicars. Childer of ancient Camirilla kindred. Agents in their sire's dealings prior to their appointments. Their sudden availability for Archonship political boons for their influential sires. The campaign begins current day 2014 with our PC's around 125 to 150 years old. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">The PC's sires are Scions of the Camarilla. Embraced sometime around 400-600AD; These Cainites could have been Princes building their power base for centuries before the Camarilla's birth. Maybe they feel above the petty squabbling of the sects but still participate in politics. Maybe they drank the kool-aid serving Camarilla interests on their own, as an Archon, even Justicar. Creatures of custom, traditions, shared agendas, and goals similar to the Camarilla. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Advance starting character template to represent age and talent. I'm looking for awesome character concepts and amazing players. Not first come first served. </span></span><img src=\"http://forum.rpg.net/images/smilies/smile.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> I will be recording our sessions for an Actual Play podcast. Depending on interest; I want our first session to be in early May. We'll be playing a few prelude games set in Boston.</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Please contact me directly at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#31465e5e55545f5c5e5f5a5448565e5571565c50585d1f525e5c\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"770018181312191a18191c120e10181337101a161e1b5914181a\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> for more information, questions, etc.</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Right on. Thanks for the interest...</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2287,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2287-woodenmonkeygod","user":"WoodenMonkeyGod","date":". 04-11-2014, 12:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2287-woodenmonkeygod","name":"WoodenMonkeyGod","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2287_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}